            "id": "3d4e2a14-23bb-4284-b949-d7db97e9e809",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for sharing your feedback. We’re glad you enjoyed the beautiful beach and ocean views. We’re sorry to hear about the dishwasher and door issues you encountered during your stay. We’ve shared your comments with our maintenance team so these can be addressed promptly. We truly appreciate you bringing this to our attention and hope to welcome you back for an even better experience next time.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Great views of the beach and oceanThe dishwasher does not work and doors are hard to open and close",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Rachel B.",
        "date": "2022-03-20T07:11:00Z",
        "id": "6238694a9b57d73db2328ba9",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Sep 15, 2023",
            "id": "a9a0734e-eb83-4a8a-aae7-80b816b9f77a",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Rachel,\nThank you for sharing your glowing review! The views, private pool & spa, private boardwalk, and central location are all wonderful amenities that make a trip to the beach feel like absolute paradise. We hope to see you again soon for another great beach getaway!\nSincerely,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nWe absolutely had a blast at this big and beautiful and well-kept home directly on the beach. The pool and hot tub was lovely, the views were spectacular, you have direct access to the beach and even a covered pavilion.",
        "title": "Paradise on the Emerald Coast!"
      },
      {
        "author": "Verified traveler",
        "date": "2023-05-20T12:54:35Z",
        "id": "6468c30b443fd162919ca368",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our family had a blast at this place. It’s our third trip down to the general area and this house was by far the best! The kids ran down to play on the beach while I drank coffee on the porch and watched them. Crab hunting, lunch, mid-afternoon nap, everything was easy because of the location of this house-plus it had everything we needed and wasn’t so fancy I was afraid our kids would break something before we could leave. It checked all our boxes. Thanks!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Amazing location! Right on the water!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Shelly M.",
        "date": "2023-09-17T00:48:45Z",
        "id": "65064cee08e6974a1d6e17d9",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Oct 1, 2023",
            "id": "99ef181a-727d-42e3-825f-8dc3a992ddd0",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hello Shelly, Thanks for staying with us at Paradise Cottage Too. We are so happy to hear that you loved the place! We really do try our best to maintain these properties and to provide an excellent beach vacation experience for guests. We have taken your comments regarding the outdoor shower into account and will bring this to the attention of the relevant parties, to ensure that this is not an issue for future stays. We do apologize for the inconvenience this may have caused during your stay with us. We also thank you for your honest feedback regarding the pests. Thanks again for choosing to stay with us! \n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "My group of 17 ladies loved this place. The beach view is spectacular. Even though the neighbors are very close, its very private. The palm trees and landscaping around the pool keep you from seeing any neighbors. The back porch is big and nice. \nWe plan to rent again. \nThe outdoor private shower is not useable, but the other rinse off stations are. The pool is very nice. \nWe had no issues with pests as was mentioned in earlier reviews.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Beautiful Place",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Allison S.",
        "date": "2024-06-02T13:26:16Z",
        "id": "665c72fc29e2a503340fc667",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jun 17, 2024",
            "id": "bac2c66e-b96c-47f9-826c-5f0f9a7f293e",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Allison, thank you for your thoughtful review. We're delighted to hear that you enjoyed the prime location of our property and that it provided ample entertainment for your teenagers. It's wonderful to know that the bunk beds were convenient and that the kitchen met your daily cooking needs, despite being smaller than you are accustomed to. We apologize for any confusion regarding the hot tub. Your feedback is invaluable, and we will ensure to communicate clearly about the amenities in the future. We're glad the pool was still a hit with the kids. Thank you for choosing our property for your stay. We hope to have the pleasure of hosting you again soon. Kind regards, Benchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house was in a perfect location, just steps from beach. I had no problem entertaining my teenagers because there was plenty to do. The bunk beds were perfect for them to be out of the way. The kitchen was a tad smaller than I’m used to, but it had plenty of what I needed to cook everyday. I loved the tankless hot water heater. I was confused when the hot tub didn’t work and the property owner told me that it was not heated, but the kids enjoyed the pool anyways. Thanks for hosting us.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Location was PERFECT, home was amazing",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
